[{:db/id -1, :suji.lex.strainReport/lexicon 1, :suji.lex.strainReport/id "com.etzhayyim.suji.strainReport", :suji.lex.strainReport/defs "{:main {:type \"record\", :key \"strainId\", :record {:type \"object\", :comment \"G1 NON-DIAGNOSTIC (医師法 §17): this record carries a mechanical load-time DOSE only. There is deliberately NO diagnosis / disease / prescription / treatment / icd / bodyPart-with-condition property, and additionalProperties=false makes any such field structurally unrepresentable (the nusa :thc-class / tazuna :weaponizable / kamado :fossil-virgin-crude pattern). A high stiffness index means 'this muscle has worked hard for a long time' — the mechanism of ordinary postural discomfort — never a clinical finding. A licensed clinician (mitate/iyashi) owns any diagnosis. ABSENCE IS ABSENT (2026-09-07): `enduranceMinutes` and `stiffnessIndex` are omitted when there is no number, rather than carrying -1. The old -1 meant two OPPOSITE things in enduranceMinutes — the model refused this muscle, and the load is below the endurance floor where the model returns ∞ (endurance effectively unlimited, the safest case) — so a consumer sorting the column numerically put the least-loaded muscles next to the ones nobody solved. In stiffnessIndex it was outside this record's own declared [0,1]. `enduranceLimit` says which kind of absence it is, in a field that cannot be sorted or averaged; `band` already did this for stiffness with :not-computed.\", :required [\"strainId\" \"postureId\" \"group\" \"side\" \"sessionMinutes\" \"enduranceLimit\" \"band\"], :additionalProperties false, :properties {:enduranceMinutes {:type \"number\", :minimum 0, :description \"Rohmert/Frey Law acute endurance limit at this %MVC. Present if and only if enduranceLimit = :finite.\"}, :asOf {:type \"integer\"}, :saturated {:type \"boolean\", :description \"the index reached 1.0 in double precision and has no resolution left\"}, :group {:type \"string\", :enum [\":anterior-deltoid\" \":biceps-brachii\" \":brachialis\" \":cervical-extensors\" \":erector-spinae\" \":gastrocnemius\" \":gluteus-maximus\" \":hamstrings\" \":iliopsoas\" \":latissimus-dorsi\" \":levator-scapulae\" \":longus-capitis\" \":middle-deltoid\" \":middle-trapezius\" \":nuchal-ligament\" \":obliques\" \":obliquus-capitis-superior\" \":posterior-lumbar-ligaments\" \":quadratus-lumborum\" \":rectus-capitis-anterior\" \":rectus-capitis-posterior-major\" \":rectus-capitis-posterior-minor\" \":rectus-femoris\" \":scalenes\" \":semispinalis-capitis\" \":soleus\" \":splenius-capitis\" \":sternocleidomastoid\" \":tibialis-anterior\" \":triceps-brachii\" \":upper-trapezius\" \":vasti\" \":wrist-extensors\" \":wrist-flexors\"], :description \"G10 — the anatomical structure, without the side; same vocabulary as muscleTension\"}, :band {:type \"string\", :enum [\":high\" \":low\" \":moderate\" \":not-computed\" \":very-high\"], :description \"coarse display band; non-diagnostic. :not-computed is its own band and NOT the lowest one — a muscle the model could not solve must not read as the least loaded thing on the page.\"}, :sessionMinutes {:type \"number\", :description \"duration the static posture was held\"}, :stiffnessIndex {:type \"number\", :minimum 0, :maximum 1, :description \"強張り — 1 - exp(-dose); SELF-REFERENCED (G3), compared only against the same member's other postures, never a population rank (非終末論, no final state). Absent when not computed; see band = :not-computed.\"}, :postureId {:type \"string\"}, :endurancePosition {:type \"string\", :enum [\":within-fitted-range\" \":below-fitted-range\" \":below-endurance-floor\" \":above-maximum-voluntary-contraction\"], :description \"where this %MVC sat relative to the meta-analysis's fitted range — the caveat travels with the number, so an answer can be told from an extrapolation\"}, :side {:type \"string\", :enum [\":left\" \":right\" \":midline\"]}, :strainId {:type \"string\"}, :enduranceLimit {:type \"string\", :enum [\":finite\" \":unbounded\" \":not-computed\"], :description \":finite — enduranceMinutes is present. :unbounded — the %MVC is below the model's own endurance floor and the power fit returns ∞; that is a modelling choice, not a measurement. :not-computed — the model refused this muscle, so there is no dose to report.\"}}}}}"}]
